        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;City choices follow Province; the explicit province-wide option preserves broad coverage.&#10;Draft and published settings differ. New quotations use published values; accepted quotes are retained.&#10;Tracking requires the configured 17TRACK account and J&amp;T carrier verification; a preview is not a live delivery test." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
